  skos:editorialNote "Source gap: Greater Gobi Desert (PA43) has an empty ecoregionSet in the One Earth Navigator data. Its page uses the heading Mongolian Desert Steppes and lists ecoregions 824, 825, and 826 in prose, while all three reciprocal ecoregion pages and the structured API associate them with Junggar Semi-Desert & Ermin Valley Steppe (PA38). This unresolved inconsistency is recorded without adding PA43 membership assertions."@en . 
